# Redirects for the static export, read by Cloudflare's static assets (wrangler.jsonc).
#
# planton.ai/install.sh is the Planton CLI installer's public address, the one every Setup Prompt
# and doc teaches. The installer itself lives where the CLI's release publishes it, stamped with
# that release, so this forwards rather than keeping a copy that would fall behind. A 302, not a
# 301: the address people paste is the permanent one, and where it points may move.
/install.sh https://downloads.planton.ai/client-apps/planton/cli/install.sh 302
